    "grade": "손증명",
    "proof": "dPhi = ell - 5 (weight-1 rotation: dP=0, dvisited=1 so dPhi=+1; joint: dP=1, dvisited=1 so dPhi=-5), and macro.remaining_window_capacity_prune is TRUE exactly when Phi < 0, so Phi >= 0 is Area A's own capacity prune. Any ell < 5 would make Phi negative and be pruned.",
